Maintainer: John Hall <john.hall@ruralinnovation.us>
Description: CORI meta-package that installs and attaches all cori.data.* companion 
    packages in a single call. Loading cori.data makes functions from 
    cori.data.qcew, cori.data.bds, cori.data.pep, cori.data.bfs, cori.data.bps, 
    cori.data.hu, cori.data.fcc, cori.data.s3, and ruraldefinitions immediately 
    available.
